[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1868.789, "timestamp": "00:31:08", "text": "，這幾乎就是代碼了。好的。  第一季進展越順利越好，對吧？是的。讓我再把它撿起來。正確的。  好的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1876.47, "timestamp": "00:31:16", "text": "我拿到了王冠。對不起。拉屎。  他媽的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1878.99, "timestamp": "00:31:18", "text": "戴上"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1882.63, "timestamp": "00:31:22", "text": "王冠了。他們應該看看我戴著"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1889.029, "timestamp": "00:31:29", "text": "[音樂]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1891.669, "timestamp": "00:31:31", "text": "哦，你也可以看看這些"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1893.43, "timestamp": "00:31:33", "text": "鏟子之類的東西。你看，裡面有東西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1900.549, "timestamp": "00:31:40", "text": "我們應該躲藏起來。  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1903.509, "timestamp": "00:31:43", "text": "。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1905.669, "timestamp": "00:31:45", "text": "好的。如果你躲在這個地方，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1907.669, "timestamp": "00:31:47", "text": "別忘了關上門。嘿"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1917.99, "timestamp": "00:31:57", "text": "我看到了物理空間。那"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1919.99, "timestamp": "00:31:59", "text": "聽起來像什麼？我想你可以躲在裡面。"}]